                    <locus target="#52r" facs="053"/>
                    <desc>
                    a small cross, written in a later hand, in the margin, in pencil, marks the midpoint of the <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2000Mazmur">Psalms of David</title>
                    </desc>
                    </item>
                    <item xml:id="a1">
                    <locus target="#130r" facs="131"/>
                    <desc type="OwnershipNote">
                    Original owner’s name has been erased and replaced by the name, Mäkfältä Maryam. Another name: [illegible] Wälättä Maryam
                    </desc>
                    </item>
                    <item xml:id="e2">
                    <locus target="#3 #15 #29 #48 #90 #108" facs="004 016 030 049 091 109"/>
                    <desc>
                    purple yarn is sewn into the fore edge to indicate location of illumination as navigation system
                    </desc>
